          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মনোযোগ (mônojog) is a learned compound of Sanskrit manas, mind, and yoga, joining (Monier-Williams): joining your mind to the task. The compound itself is not in the dictionary. মনোযোগ দিয়ে means 'carefully, with attention'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
